# satishfulwani.github.io

Static personal portfolio. No build step. PRs run **Validate site** (`.github/workflows/validate.yml`: `html-validate` + local link checks in `.github/scripts/validate-site.sh`). GitHub Pages deploys the repo root via `.github/workflows/static.yml` on push to `main` (validate, then deploy). Resume PDF is regenerated on `main` when `resume.html` or `custom.css` change via `.github/workflows/resume-pdf.yml` (`.github/scripts/generate-resume-pdf.sh`).

## Pages

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `index.html` | Single-page marketing site (hero → work → projects → experience → about → credentials → contact) |
| `projects.html` | Case studies; work anchors first, then personal projects |
| `resume.html` | Printable resume; `@media print` rules must stay intact |

Shared: `custom.css`, `script.js`, `assets/` (images, `Satish_Fulwani_Resume.pdf`).

## Resume PDF

`generate_pdf.sh` (local wrapper) and `.github/scripts/generate-resume-pdf.sh` print `resume.html` with headless Chrome/Chromium to `assets/Satish_Fulwani_Resume.pdf`. Nav **Resume** on all pages opens `resume.html`; the resume page action bar offers **Download PDF** (stored file) and print/save via the browser.

